# w.lang.en/shards/phrases: the grammar phrase groups and small lexicons of lang.common (worlds/lang.common/lexicon.sop), re-typed as lang.en.phrase / lang.en.lex. Only the groups that say how English builds a
# request, a question, an answer, a joiner, an ellipsis or a negation; the groups that name an application intent (lang.intent.*, lang.doc.*, lang.game.*, lang.talk.*) stay in the apps.
# sources: PSys2 worlds/lang.common (hand-written and seeded from the per-world lead-in lists by scripts/build-lang-common.mjs)
# license: CC0-1.0

